OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers warned about entering
OL,4,Aderelict buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeenagers are being warned about the
OL,7,Fdangers of entering abandoned and
OL,8,Fderelict buildings across Jersey.
OL,10,FThe honorary police has sent secondary
OL,11,Fschools a letter after several
OL,12,Fincidents were reported over the
OL,13,Fsummer, with some young people
OL,14,Fsustaining injuries.
OL,16,FThe voluntary force said its aim was
OL,17,Fnot to "criminalise young people who
OL,18,Fare curious or adventurous" but instead
OL,19,Fto prevent them from becoming injured
OL,20,For involved in behaviour "which could
OL,21,Fbring them into the criminal justice
OL,22,Fsystem".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
