OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers warned about entering
OL,4,Aderelict buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident of the Jersey Honorary Police
OL,7,FAssociation Ben Wheaton said although
OL,8,Fbuildings may appear "interesting to
OL,9,Fexplore", they could instead be
OL,10,F"extremely dangerous".
